### 3.2 Apache Iceberg on Amazon S3

Apache Iceberg eliminates historical S3 file-listing latency bottlenecks (`S3 ListObjects` $O(N)$ overhead) by tracking files using hierarchical metadata JSON/Avro structures.

```
